sequenceDiagram
actor Owner
participant Route as Owner Action
participant Policy
participant Publish
participant DB as Postgres UoW
participant Outbox
participant Cache
Owner->>Route: Publish(expectedRevision)
Route->>Policy: Owner + CSRF + object permission
Policy-->>Route: Permit
Route->>Publish: Validated command
Publish->>DB: BEGIN
Publish->>DB: published snapshot + revision + audit
Publish->>DB: durable outbox intent
DB-->>Publish: COMMIT
Publish-->>Route: Server-confirmed success
Outbox-->>Cache: Retryable invalidation
Note over Route,Cache: No successful publish response on failed DB commit
